      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "docker/README.md",
      "patch": "@@ -124,7 +124,7 @@ docker build \\\n | `CUBLAS_VER` | cuBLAS version for the TRT-LLM install scripts |\n | `NVRTC_VER` | NVRTC version for the TRT-LLM install scripts |\n | `REINSTALL_NSYS` | Set to `True` to reinstall Nsight Systems from the NVIDIA apt repo |\n-| `NSYS_VERSION` | Nsight Systems version (e.g. `2026.1.0.1085`) |\n+| `NSYS_VERSION` | Nsight Systems version (e.g. `2026.5.1`) |\n | `REINSTALL_CUDNN` | Set to `True` to reinstall cuDNN from the NVIDIA apt repo |\n | `CUDNN_VERSION` | cuDNN apt version (e.g. `9.18.1.3-1`) |\n | `REINSTALL_NCCL` | Set to `True` to reinstall NCCL from the NVIDIA apt repo |",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/raw/fe90cf0c4e7d46a03c04674834bde2f29b87c3f2/docker%2FREADME.md",
      "sha": "edaa72ed3db26e7a44b1899c8ab18251585e46a6",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/blob/fe90cf0c4e7d46a03c04674834bde2f29b87c3f2/docker%2Fcommon%2Finstall_nsys.sh",
      "changes": 2,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/contents/docker%2Fcommon%2Finstall_nsys.sh?ref=fe90cf0c4e7d46a03c04674834bde2f29b87c3f2",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "docker/common/install_nsys.sh",
      "patch": "@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ ARCH=$(uname -m)\n if [ \"$ARCH\" = \"amd64\" ]; then ARCH=\"x86_64\"; fi\n if [ \"$ARCH\" = \"aarch64\" ]; then ARCH=\"sbsa\"; fi\n \n-# Extract year.major for package name (e.g., \"2026.1.0.1085\" -> \"nsight-systems-2026.1\")\n+# Extract year.major for package name (e.g., \"2026.5.1\" -> \"nsight-systems-2026.5\")\n NSYS_YEAR_MAJOR=$(echo \"$NSYS_VERSION\" | cut -d. -f1,2)\n NSYS_PKG=\"nsight-systems-${NSYS_YEAR_MAJOR}\"\n ",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/raw/fe90cf0c4e7d46a03c04674834bde2f29b87c3f2/docker%2Fcommon%2Finstall_nsys.sh",
